[Cheats/Unlock Debug Menu At Startup HIGDON This menu contains quite a bit of variety on what you can do here.Selecting ipu will allow you to view all of the background images. Selecting movie will allow you to watch all the movies in the game.Tex2D This menu contain's options to view all of the images in the game and adjust them to your leisure. sound You can listen to all the music here, as well as SFX and voices.AnmObj This option will allow you to view all the sprites in the game, as well as their animations. You can also change the background color, sprite color, and positions of them.illusion This option allows you to select and view all the special effects here. There is options to save the edits to a HDD, memory card, or a PC as well here. It's unclear how those options work.Buc You can view all of the character images and edit them here.DqEdit A dungeon part editor can be seen here. You can even make entire new dungeons here. There is options to save the edits to a HDD, memory card, or a PC as well here. It's unclear how those options work.
DunTest This option allows you to view all of the dungeons in the game.DunWalk This option allows you to walk around in all of the dungeons in the game. It will also display a few debug options as well.Y.TAKEZAWA This sub-menu contains a lot of options relating to a variety of things you can do here.T.NAKAI This menu mostly contains a variety of different battle test options.BtlTest This option allows you to enter test battles with your choice of enemies and party members.BtlSkillTest This option allows you to change various attack patterns for enemies and party members.BtlEffectMc This option allows you to select and change various in-battle skill effects.EffectBaseTest Inside this option you can change all of the parameters for effects that affect party members and text] 
patch=1,EE,003482EC,extended,00000000


